  "interpretation": [
    "CORE is intentionally fragile and should be treated as the low-odds lane: at the minimum threshold it only tolerates about 10% probability overestimation before edge disappears.",
    "MID_HOLE at threshold tolerates about 35% overestimation.",
    "LONGSHOT at threshold tolerates about 75% overestimation.",
    "EXTREME_LONGSHOT at threshold tolerates a 2.5x probability overestimate before break-even.",
    "This does not prove calibration. It proves that the proposed thresholds become more conservative as odds increase.",
